  m_text: '<b><u>Get Golf Ball</u></b>

    <size=0.05>Keyboard - B

    Controller
    - B or Circle</size>


    <b><u>Play Ball / Open Ball Cam</u></b>

    <size=0.05>Keyboard
    - E

    Controller - X or Square</size>


    <b><u>Hit Ball (With Camera Open)</u></b>

    <size=0.05>Keyboard
    - Space

    Mouse - Hold Left Click and pull mouse back

    Controller - A
    or Cross

    Controller Advanced - Hold LT and use RT for power

    </size>'
